WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:17.160
Rie, look!

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.660
A friend gave me this
when she came to visit!

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:24.540
I hid it under my bed
so the doctors wouldn't see.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.250
You can have some.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:27.830
No thanks.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.500
Dummy. Don't you know you can't use
the word "visit" around her right now?

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:35.800
Her sister-complex brother
didn't show up on the last visit day.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.180
And so she's sulking.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.510
I'm sorry, Rie.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:43.310
Brother doesn't need me anymore.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.230
There she goes again.

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:49.480
Blargh-blargh!

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.400
What are you doing?

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.280
I wanted to make Rie laugh.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.950
Sayori, today is the day
you can go outside. Let's go.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:04.790
But...

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.120
Go ahead and go.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.870
Rie's always like this
when something happens.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.250
Yeah. I'll bring back presents.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.050
Look forward to it, Rie.
You too, Shoko!

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:27.180
First, does anyone know
who this statue was made by?

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:28.600
Matoba.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:31.190
Michelangelo.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:36.320
A painter, sculptor and architect
during the Italian Renaissance period.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.780
He was also a poet and has left
a huge influence on the art world.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.200
Wonderful, a perfect answer.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:49.040
"I saw the angel in the marble
and carved until I set him free."

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.380
His words were an inspiration
to me, as well.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.710
-That's Matoba for you!
-He's so special, right?

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.390
Matoba's so great! Take me!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.600
Stop. Don't mess with him!

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.720
Don't tell me you love him too.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:10.190
Idiot! He gets scary when he's mad.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.600
You should just stay away from him!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:27.580
Gai, we're friends...
But we're not friends!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.250
We're friends, but...

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.460
Don't pout so much.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.250
You're not a little girl.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.460
I am a little girl.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:37.670
I see.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.970
There was probably a reason
your brother couldn't come.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.350
You have at least one family member
who cares about you.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.930
That's a wonderful thing by itself.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.810
You'll get cursed if you start complaining
after one missed visit.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:59.280
I'm a little jealous of you.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.780
Shoko?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.070
It's nothing.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.240
Anyway, cheer up. Okay?

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.120
I know. I'll pretend to be your brother.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.710
What's that?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.960
I'll pretend
to be your sister-obsessed brother.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.710
You can think of me
as your beloved brother!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.390
Brother, did you forget about me?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.800
I'd never forget you!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:31.390
You're my only sister!
There's no way I'd forget you!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.600
Then why didn't you come?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:37.020
I ate too much barbecue and got sick.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.400
Brother wouldn't do that.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:41.570
No?

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:48.070
You're sure this
is where you wanted to go?

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.450
We could've gone
to a theme park, or anywhere else.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:55.620
It's okay.
I don't really like roller coasters.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.500
I like quiet places like this the most.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.550
Are you taking it back?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.720
Yeah, as a present for them.
Do you think they'll like it?

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.730
I'm sure they will.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.940
You're a kind girl, Sayori.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.900
And you're always so obedient.
It's a big help for me.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.900
You think?

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.320
Do you also want
to leave the hospital soon?

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:32.120
I don't really mind the hospital,
though I don't like the pain.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.580
I've got Rie and Shoko, too.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.380
And it hurts no matter where I go.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.500
But your heart seeks freedom.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:48.720
Once you're out of the hospital,
I'll cook you all the meat you want.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.010
Kalbi, beef tongue, skirt steak,
anything you want!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:56.060
I said brother's not like that!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.140
I'm back.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.110
You two seem to be having fun.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.980
-Doctor! Sayori!
-Hey there.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.860
I'm glad you're doing better, Rie.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.450
I brought you a present.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.490
So pretty!

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:15.580
A butterfly?

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.960
I would've rather you brought food.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.380
That's so loud.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:24.380
What's wrong?

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.720
I'm fine. It's nothing.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.470
Sayori, you're hurt.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:35.140
It's been a while since she went outside.
She must be tired.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.890
You were very excited, huh?
You ran around a lot.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.650
Was I?

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.980
Oh, Shoko. You have a visitor.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.280
I do?

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:50.660
Yes, your mother is here.
You should go see her.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.120
Her? Why?

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:56.450
Because she wants to see you, of course.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.500
That's a lie!
Today isn't visiting day anyway!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:04.130
It's not often she can come.
So it’s a special occasion.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.130
But...

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.090
Run along and go see her.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:10.510
She said she wanted to see
if you were doing well.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.100
That woman said that?
It makes me want to throw up!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.220
Don't say that.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.020
Come on.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.600
Never!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:22.270
Leave!

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.310
That's too bad.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:29.780
What's wrong, Shoko?

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.570
Did you have a fight with your mom?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.370
The mom I have now isn't my real mom.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.870
She's my stepmom.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.670
I see. That's why...

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.250
No. That woman...

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.260
She killed my mom.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.300
When I was five...

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.940
I told my dad
and the other grown-ups what I saw.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:08.650
But everyone dismissed it
as ramblings from a child.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.690
Nobody listened to me.

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:16.320
After Mom's death, she took advantage
of my father's grief and they got married.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.950
Just like she planned.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.620
That's why...

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.500
I hate her!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.040
I think I understand a little.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.420
Mom and Dad hurt me every day.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.940
How is the research going?

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.030
Extremely well, thank you.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:59.160
The life energy extracted
from several living weapons, Maldicion.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:04.250
We're injecting it into the subjects,
making them greater than humans.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:08.750
The bracelets they wear influence
a human's Astral Body,

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.800
allowing them to maintain their sanity.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.960
But when they're removed,

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.180
the subjects become beasts,
killing on instinct.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:19.640
But they haven't completely
become a Busoma yet.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:25.770
The Shoshidai will offer all its support.
Finish the project as quickly as possible.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.060
Yes, I'm aware.

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.270
How are the subjects doing?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:37.030
Brainwave patterns are disturbed
and Maldicion values are rising rapidly.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.080
Then the lie worked.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:42.990
Lie?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.000
You're aware, yes?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:50.750
They all have terrible pasts,
and immense hatred keeps them alive.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:56.340
That hatred is an absolute requirement
for the subjects of this experiment.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.260
Yes.

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:01.680
You said hatred is the bridge
that connects humanity to the Busoma.

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:05.810
Saying her mother's name
tainted her heart with hatred.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:11.310
Sometimes,
we need to sharpen their claws.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:16.950
So that they don't forget their hatred
in their long stay here.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.660
Please continue the observation.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.030
Yes sir.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.980
Which of you is Rie?

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:59.490
It's time for your exam.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.330
This place is a mess.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.290
Was this his doing as well?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:09.660
Most likely.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.500
The evil aura
of the Shiryu fills this place.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.800
Gai... What a dangerous man.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.060
Ogata!

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:34.360
Ogata, I'm sorry!

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:38.530
I'm so sorry about what I said last time!

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.530
I said something
without thinking of your feelings.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.570
No, it was my fault too.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.660
I was acting a little crazy.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:51.250
A lot happened and I panicked.
And so I took my anxiety out on you.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.000
I'll never do it again.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.800
I'll work hard so
that you can love me back. Is that okay?

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.470
Matoba...

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:11.480
I found you. A friend.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.060
You're from that time...

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.320
You're his friend.

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.070
So please, get him back
to the way he was.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:22.990
My friend, Gai is...

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:30.290
You know Gai? Is he really alive?
Tell me! Where is he?

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:34.750
It looks like there's been an incident.
Did something happen to him?

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.840
Gai is my only friend.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:43.840
But Gai changed!
He's not my friend now!

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.140
Save him!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.220
I don't understand
what you're saying at all.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.520
RECEIVING CALL
FATHER

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.650
Father, what is it?

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.520
<i>Shin, it's terrible. Rie was...</i>

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:04.860
What's wrong, Matoba?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.280
Rie was kidnapped.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:11.870
And by a Busoma... A monster.

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:13.080
No...

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.500
Why Rie?

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.750
Please! Take me to where Gai is!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:24.920
O-Okay.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.980
Wh-What is this? What happened?

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.770
The news didn't say anything about this!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.860
Did a Busoma do this?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.320
Gai... Gai is...

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:47.410
Is Gai really in a place like this?

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:10.470
So you came.

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:17.810
Gai!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:25.070
Gai, you're really alive!
Why didn't you come home right away?

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.820
Do you know how worried
Father and I were?

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.280
You dummy!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.370
Gai?

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.330
You again?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.790
Gai, I need your help.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.960
A Busoma kidnapped my sister.

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.470
I hate to say it,
but I can't save her, right?

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.510
I'd like your help.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:54.060
Last time, the Shiryu guided me
and brought me to you.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:56.970
So I thought that maybe you could...

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.980
Fine, I'll help you.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:27.260
Where am I? Who are you?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.930
Why did you bring me here?
What are you going to do to me?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:35.560
I have nothing to say to you.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:39.180
If you hurt me, brother will get you!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.730
He always protects me!

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.060
I hope he beats you up!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.610
So noisy!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.860
Shut up for a minute.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:56.910
You're bait, got it?
Bait to wake up your dazed brother.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.960
Grimms wants to make him
into a Busoma, he says.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.330
Maybe I should just kill you.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.840
Your brother will go crazy
if he sees your dead body,

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.840
and the Shiryu will take him over again!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.870
What are you? A monster?

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.710
Is your sister really
in a place like this?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:48.090
Rie's bracelet has a GPS. I'm sure of it.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:57.090
I don't know what will happen,
but I'm sure you'll be in danger.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.850
Can you stay here?

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.890
Please, let me go with you.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:05.350
I'm worried about everyone,
and Gai's acting weird.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:10.320
If you say so.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.610
Rie's GPS signal disappeared... Why?

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.030
This way.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.500
I thought you were just a kid,
but you're not bad!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:33.840
But you're not as cute or strong as me!

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:42.850
Rie!

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.730
Busoma, where's Rie?

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.690
Where are you going?

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:56.110
You're from that...

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.160
You're a Busoma too? Where's Rie?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.290
Just one left?

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.080
That's fine.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.920
I can have more fun with you
than with humans.

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:23.220
Gai? It can't be...

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.020
Gai, turn back! I don't want this!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.610
Please, you can hear me, right?

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.570
Gai...

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.150
Ogata!

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:40.110
Your voice won't reach him.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.660
Hang in there, Ogata!

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:55.090
What, you want to play with me?

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.920
Fight! Offer me your blood!

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.510
Is that some new pick-up line?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.280
Wake up, please!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.240
Gai... Why?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.410
<i>Kill.</i>

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.080
<i>Kill.</i>

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.040
<i>Kill.</i>

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.670
<i>Kill.</i>

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.090
<i>Kill.</i>

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:43.390
Not bad. But now--

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.600
You...

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.190
You're in the way, trash.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.370
I knew it. It's just as Grimms said.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:10.000
You're one of us.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:14.500
So it's game over for me?
I guess that's fine.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.210
It was a pretty good game.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:30.270
I'll never forgive you. I'll fight.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:33.270
To defeat all Busoma.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.310
You will awaken soon as well.
